Hi {Owner},

I build websites for machine shops and CNC job shops around {City}. I couldn't find a way for an engineer to send {Business Name} a model and a drawing, or to see what you machine, without calling.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: an RFQ that takes STEP files and PDF drawings with quantity breaks, a file handling and NDA section, a prototype-to-production path, and a lead-time window you can update, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
